@startuml LICP_Sequence_Compliance_Simple
scale 0.9
skinparam shadowing false

actor Admin
actor "Compliance\nOfficer" as CO
participant API
database DB

Admin -> API : Sync regulatory feed
API -> DB : Save RegulatoryUpdate

CO -> API : Review update
API -> DB : Mark reviewed

CO -> API : Create obligation
API -> DB : Save ComplianceObligation

CO -> API : Upload evidence
API -> DB : Save evidence + update status

@enduml
